# Apple Direct
# Focused on Apple infrastructure where mainland DIRECT is normally beneficial:
# App Store assets, iCloud / CloudKit, push, maps and OS/software updates.
# This deliberately does NOT route all apple.com / Apple TV+ / Apple News DIRECT.
# Baseline comes from the user's previously working Tower profile, with
# Apple update / iCloud references cross-checked against v2fly/domain-list-community.

# App Store / static assets
